<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chălybs</span></b> , ybis,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλυψ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>steel</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">Plin.
				34, 14, 41, § 142 sq.</span></i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulnificus (because weapons were made of it),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 446</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">on account of its hardness: ferro durior et
					chalybe,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 1, 16, 30</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Sen. Herc. Oet. 152</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 1,
			171</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2,
			403</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>the things made of
				it.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A sword</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strictus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Thyest. 364</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A horse</i>'<i>s bit</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 6,
			398</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>The point of an arrow</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 7,
			518</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 342</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 2,
				107 al.</span></i>— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<i>An iron rail</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 6,
			547</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
